          "content": "B\n\nThe coworker's family has just lost their home and needs immediate shelter. Your son still has shoes that fit and can play the season. I'd give the money to them, sit down with my son, and explain honestly that a family in crisis needed the help more urgently right now. It makes the promise painful to break, but the difference in severity\u2014a broken home vs. worn sneakers\u2014points the same way.",
